Revision history for Medusa-XS

0.01    Date/time
        First version, released on an unsuspecting world.

0.03    2026-10-08
        - Horus and Loo are configure-time prerequisites: Makefile.PL needs
          their headers. Minimums raised to the first releases that install
          them (Horus 0.02, Loo 0.05).
        - %ms prints three digits where tv_usec is wider than a long.
        - Builds on Windows.
        - t/15-elapsed.t no longer requires the call to take under a second.
